      "retrieved": "2026-10-12",
      "revision": 1370944192,
      "text": "Ziziphus lotus is a small deciduous tree in the buckthorn family Rhamnaceae, native to the Mediterranean region, including the Sahara in Morocco and also Somalia. It is one of several species called \"jujube\", and is closely related to Z. jujuba, the true jujube."
